<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns one secondary credit.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns one secondary credit.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has assigned one of two credit auctions in the secondary market whereby it sought to inject 2.149 billion pesos on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The credits were offered or assigned as follows:</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     MAX    MIN    AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.149  bln pesos   2 days  31.81  31.69  31.78    7    3</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos   1 day</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
